<title>USA: Wackenhut wins 25-year, $10.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Wackenhut wins 25-year, $10.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wackenhut Corrections Corp said Monday its United Kingdom joint-venture company has finalized contracts to reconstruct, design and manage a 500-bed prison in Nottinghamshire, England.</p>
<p>Wackenhut said project construction costs are expected to be $46.5 million, and the 25-year contract for management of the prison is expected to generate company revenues of about $10.5 million per year, subject to annual indexed adjustments.  </p>
<p>Construction of the facility is scheduled to begin this month, the company said.</p>
</text>
